    "description": "Objective\n\nDetermine whether a custom Aura page template gives a materially better Rep layout than the standard templates.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Investigate a two-region layout with History tucked behind a tab\n\n* Timeboxed to \\~1 hour (Jester)\n\n* Kobi to build 2-3 layout variants and review them with Wagertech in a single pass\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Variants reviewed with Wagertech in one session and a single layout selected\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nNeeds a due date or it will drift. The one-pass review is the point — avoid iterating layouts across multiple client sessions.\n\nSTATUS: In Progress.\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 39.",
